ociation":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible on Android builds only, not on Windows builds (maybe not true, can be related to touch input). _Tested on Galaxy Tab S9, Android 14._\n\n- Reproducible in: **4.3.rc1**, 4.4.rc3\n- Not reproducible in: **4.3.beta3**, 4.2.2\n\nBehaves exactly the same way in respective versions on the Android device in web builds at https://editor.godotengine.org/.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.rc1 - Android - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Adreno (TM) 740 -  (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm unable to drag files into 2d scene or into inspector from `FileSystem` dock. FYI dragging nodes from `Scene` dock (for example into code editor) works as expected.\n\n_I was not able to drag files with a touchpad as well, but maybe it does not register as a proper mouse (galaxy tab book cover with keyboard and touchpad)._\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate an empty project, have some files in FileSystem dock (image, tscn, ...). Try to drag files from FileSystem dock into other parts of the editor (2d editor, inspector, etc.).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNew and empty project is sufficient.","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"